{"id":"t-pay","locale":"en","title":"T-Pay","updated":"2026-09-27T19:31:59.228Z","baseHtml":"","publishedHtml":"<div class=\"imported-api\"><p><br></p><figure style=\"text-align:center\"><img data-image-id=\"7384bace-0fd3-4416-bd53-6f157b12e336\" src=\"static/img/editor/88aeecb179df4ad95be794ee8c362d39bba911065c761e907c40a831a2850704.png\" alt=\"Изображение ChatGPT 27 сент. 2026 г., 22_30_30.png\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto\"></figure><p>CloudPayments offers a one-click payment method through T-Pay. The customer can choose any payment account in the T-Bank app, as well as earn T-Bank cashback for future purchases.</p><p>T-Pay payments can be accepted through the SDK. You can implement this either through the CloudPayments payment form or as a separate button.</p><p>See the documentation for more details:</p><ul><li><p>SDK for <a href=\"/en/SDK-dlya-iOS/\">iOS</a></p></li><li><p>SDK for <a href=\"/en/SDK-dlya-Android/\">Android</a></p></li></ul><p> </p><h2 id=\"section-46286627-5a28-43ef-8c90-f532d4915cde\"><strong>Get a payment link</strong></h2><h3 id=\"section-dfc68271-e6de-4492-ad49-2104ecb54f3a\"><strong>Description</strong></h3><p>Method for getting the payment link to redirect the customer to the bank’s mobile app.</p><p>The response will return the <code>QrUrl</code> parameter with the redirect URL.</p><p>To process the payment, redirect the customer to the received URL.</p><h3 id=\"section-a3c4288b-7688-428c-abf7-f9e5fffa86dc\"><strong>Endpoint</strong></h3><p>https://api.cloudpayments.ru/payments/qr/tinkoffpay/link</p><h3 id=\"section-9153612d-e8a1-4c43-974c-f096f5c1ee62\">Request parameters</h3><div class=\"api-table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Таблица\"><table><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Parameter</p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Format</p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Required</p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Description</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>publicId</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>string</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Yes</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Website ID, can be found in the dashboard</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Amount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>decimal</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Yes</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>The payment amount in the transaction currency. Use a dot as the decimal separator. Number of decimal places: 2</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Currency</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>string</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Yes</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Currency: RUB (see the reference)</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Scheme</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>enum string</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Yes</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Payment processing method (see Transaction types). Possible values: <code>0</code> for single-stage payment, <code>1</code> for two-stage payment</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Browser</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>string</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Yes</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Customer&#39;s browser name derived from the browser&#39;s <code>User-Agent</code> string. Example values: <code>Chrome</code>, <code>Firefox</code>, <code>MIUI Browser</code>, <code>Opera</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Os</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>string</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Yes</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Payer&#39;s device operating system. Example values: <code>Android</code>, <code>iOS</code>, <code>Windows</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Webview</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>bool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Yes</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Indicator of whether the browser is running in WebView mode. Possible values: <code>true</code> for payments using webview, <code>false</code> for payments without webview</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Device</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>enum string</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Yes</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Payer&#39;s device type flag. Possible values: <code>MobileApp</code> for payments initiated from a mobile app, <code>DesktopWeb</code> for payments initiated from a desktop browser, <code>Mobile</code> for payments initiated from a mobile browser</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>SuccessRedirectUrl</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>string</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Yes</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Customer redirect URL after a successful payment. Once the payment is processed, the customer will be redirected from the bank&#39;s mobile app to the specified URL</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>FailRedirectUrl</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>string</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Yes</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>URL for redirecting the customer after a failed payment. Once the payment is processed, the customer will be redirected from the bank&#39;s mobile app to the specified URL</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>IpAddress</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>string</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>No</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Payer IP address</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>AccountId</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>string</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>No</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>User ID</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Email</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>string</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>No</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Payer email</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>InvoiceId</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>string</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>No</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Invoice or order number</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Description</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>string</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>No</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Payment description (free-form)</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>JsonData</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>JSON</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>No</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Any other data associated with the transaction, including instructions for creating a subscription or generating an online receipt, must be wrapped in the <code>cloudpayments</code> object. We have reserved the names of the following parameters and their values are displayed in the transaction register downloaded from the dashboard: <code>name</code>, <code>firstName</code>, <code>middleName</code>, <code>lastName</code>, <code>nick</code>, <code>phone</code>, <code>address</code>, <code>comment</code>, <code>birthDate</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>TtlMinutes</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>int</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>No</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Time window during which the payment via QR code or payment link remains available. If this parameter is omitted, the payment can be completed within 24 hours. <strong>Important:</strong> <code>0</code> is considered incorrect and may lead to a request processing error. If the time limit is not required, either do not pass this parameter or explicitly set it to <code>null</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>SaveCard</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>bool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>No</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Flag indicating whether to save the card token for payments via a stored card. Possible values: <code>true</code>: after a successful payment, the card token will be returned, <code>false</code>: the token will not be returned (default). The <code>SaveCard</code> parameter is only processed when the &quot;Save a card token&quot; setting is enabled in the dashboard. If the &quot;Force Save&quot; setting is enabled, the <code>SaveCard</code> parameter will be ignored</p></td></tr></table></div><p>The server returns a JSON response with the following three properties:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Success</strong>: request result</p></li><li><p><strong>Message</strong>: error description</p></li><li><p><strong>Model</strong>: additional information</p></li></ul><p>Response examples:</p><ol start=\"1\"><li><p>Malformed request:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Success</strong>: false</p></li><li><p><strong>Message</strong>: error description</p></li></ul></li><li><p>Transaction declined:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Success</strong>: false</p></li><li><p><strong>Model</strong>: transaction information and an error code</p></li></ul></li><li><p>Transaction accepted:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Success</strong>: true</p></li><li><p><strong>Model</strong>: transaction information</p></li></ul></li></ol><p><strong>Notice:</strong> The request result (the <code>Success</code> field) does not reflect the transaction status; it only indicates the success or failure of the API request. The transaction status is reflected in the additional <code>Status</code> field, and can also be obtained via received notifications. For the interpretation of transaction statuses, see reference.</p><p><br></p><h3 id=\"section-6adf2f9a-0008-4d71-acf5-bb5218fb768c\"><strong>Request example</strong></h3><div class=\"api-code-block\"><div class=\"api-code-toolbar\"><span>javascript</span><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code=\"editor-code-1\" data-copy-state=\"ready\" aria-label=\"Копировать код\" title=\"Копировать код\"><svg class=\"api-copy-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"11\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M6 15H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"api-copy-success\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\"/></svg><span class=\"api-copy-status\" data-copy-status role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></button></div><pre class=\"api-code\"><code id=\"editor-code-1\" class=\"language-javascript\">{\n    &quot;Amount&quot;: &quot;10&quot;,\n    &quot;AccountId&quot;: &quot;someId&quot;,\n    &quot;InvoiceId&quot;: 12345,\n    &quot;Browser&quot;: &quot;Chrome&quot;,\n    &quot;Currency&quot;: &quot;RUB&quot;,\n    &quot;Device&quot;: &quot;Mobile&quot;,\n    &quot;Description&quot;: &quot;Payment with T-Pay&quot;,\n    &quot;Email&quot;: &quot;email@email.com&quot;,\n    &quot;IpAddress&quot;: &quot;123.123.123.123&quot;,\n    &quot;Os&quot;: &quot;Android&quot;,\n    &quot;Scheme&quot;: 1,\n    &quot;TtlMinutes&quot;: 30,\n    &quot;SuccessRedirectUrl&quot;: &quot;https://cp.ru&quot;,\n    &quot;FailRedirectUrl&quot;: &quot;https://cp.ru&quot;,\n    &quot;Webview&quot;: false\n}</code></pre></div><h3 id=\"section-caee758c-031d-4e05-a32c-2a90b7a946c6\"><strong>Response example</strong></h3><div class=\"api-code-block\"><div class=\"api-code-toolbar\"><span>javascript</span><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code=\"editor-code-2\" data-copy-state=\"ready\" aria-label=\"Копировать код\" title=\"Копировать код\"><svg class=\"api-copy-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"11\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M6 15H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"api-copy-success\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\"/></svg><span class=\"api-copy-status\" data-copy-status role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></button></div><pre class=\"api-code\"><code id=\"editor-code-2\" class=\"language-javascript\">{\n    &quot;Model&quot;: {\n        &quot;QrUrl&quot;: &quot;{URL-address}&quot;,\n        &quot;QrImage&quot;: null,\n        &quot;TransactionId&quot;: 11122233344,\n        &quot;MerchantOrderId&quot;: &quot;12345&quot;,\n        &quot;ProviderQrId&quot;: &quot;&quot;,\n        &quot;Amount&quot;: 10,\n        &quot;Message&quot;: &quot;Created&quot;,\n        &quot;IsTest&quot;: false\n    },\n    &quot;Success&quot;: true,\n    &quot;Message&quot;: null\n}</code></pre></div><p> </p><h2 id=\"section-557bcc7b-8911-42a7-a187-b10408add639\"><strong>Get a QR code for payment</strong></h2><h3 id=\"section-58800cdc-3098-4a91-950b-d9d7905489ac\"><strong>Description</strong></h3><p>Method for getting the QR code to show the customer in the browser.</p><p>Response will return the <code>QrImage</code> parameter containing a QR code in imageSVG format for displaying to the customer. The string value is Base64-encoded.</p><h3 id=\"section-d58c28a2-6b07-4c4f-b4ad-133e6ddc503f\"><strong>Endpoint</strong></h3><p>https://api.cloudpayments.ru/payments/qr/tinkoffpay/image</p><h3 id=\"section-4300bfc5-3115-4701-8893-d78bfcbebfb7\"><strong>Request parameters</strong></h3><p><a href=\"/en/t-pay/#section-46286627-5a28-43ef-8c90-f532d4915cde\">See also T-Pay. Get a payment link</a></p><h3 id=\"section-92a3b23c-5272-4cf4-b255-f429e007bc0c\"><strong>Request example</strong></h3><p><a href=\"/en/t-pay/#section-46286627-5a28-43ef-8c90-f532d4915cde\">See also T-Pay. Get a payment link</a></p><h3 id=\"section-2dc4d415-9f03-4aaf-acaf-0c25c25aab44\"><strong>Response example</strong></h3><div class=\"api-code-block\"><div class=\"api-code-toolbar\"><span>javascript</span><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code=\"editor-code-3\" data-copy-state=\"ready\" aria-label=\"Копировать код\" title=\"Копировать код\"><svg class=\"api-copy-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"11\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M6 15H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"api-copy-success\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\"/></svg><span class=\"api-copy-status\" data-copy-status role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></button></div><pre class=\"api-code\"><code id=\"editor-code-3\" class=\"language-javascript\">{\n    &quot;Model&quot;: {\n        &quot;QrUrl&quot;: null,\n        &quot;QrImage&quot;: &quot;{string}&quot;,\n        &quot;TransactionId&quot;: 11122233344,\n        &quot;MerchantOrderId&quot;: &quot;12345&quot;,\n        &quot;ProviderQrId&quot;: &quot;&quot;,\n        &quot;Amount&quot;: 10,\n        &quot;Message&quot;: &quot;Created&quot;,\n        &quot;IsTest&quot;: false\n    },\n    &quot;Success&quot;: true,\n    &quot;Message&quot;: null\n}</code></pre></div><p><br></p></div>","content":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"","alt":"Изображение ChatGPT 27 сент. 2026 г., 22_30_30.png","title":null,"width":100,"height":null,"imageId":"7384bace-0fd3-4416-bd53-6f157b12e336","caption":"","assetPath":"editor-assets/f95ed7d9-8797-4aa5-8a1a-c10696ec5f0f.png","align":"center"}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"CloudPayments offers a one-click payment method through T-Pay. The customer can choose any payment account in the T-Bank app, as well as earn T-Bank cashback for future purchases."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"T-Pay payments can be accepted through the SDK. You can implement this either through the CloudPayments payment form or as a separate button."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"See the documentation for more details:"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"SDK for "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"/en/SDK-dlya-iOS/","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","class":null,"title":null}}],"text":"iOS"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"SDK for "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"/en/SDK-dlya-Android/","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","class":null,"title":null}}],"text":"Android"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"section-46286627-5a28-43ef-8c90-f532d4915cde","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Get a payment link"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"section-dfc68271-e6de-4492-ad49-2104ecb54f3a","level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Description"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Method for getting the payment link to redirect the customer to the bank’s mobile app."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The response will return the "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"QrUrl"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter with the redirect URL."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"To process the payment, redirect the customer to the received URL."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"section-a3c4